<title>CROATIA: Croatia June currency reserves rise to $4.4 bln.</title>
<headline>Croatia June currency reserves rise to $4.4 bln.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA CURRENCY RESERVES    JUNE	  MAY	 JUNE 96</p>
<p> Total (million USD)	  4,387.6     4,202.9     3,927.2</p>
<p> National Bank of Croatia   2,326.5     2,271.9     2,019.1</p>
<p> Commercial banks	     2,061.1     1,931.0     1,908.1 NOTE</p>
<p>-- Central bank June reserves rose 2.4 percent from May.</p>
<p>Commercial banks' reserves rose 6.7 percent after dipping in May.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb newsroom + 385 1 455 7075</p>
</text>
